#showas:迷宫
A highly difficult bonus scenario. Two AIs this time which are set to difficulty 9.

Map type is "Maze D", with 81 planets, very different from "Realistic". The AIs are a Turtle, focusing on reinforcements and defenses, and a Vicious Raider, an extremely offensive orientated type that really likes raiding type units.

Your starting fleets are all the default options.

While the two AIs are a lower difficulty than before, this combination can lead to planets gaining additional ships at a scary rate, and enormous waves that can be hard to repel.

In addition, both Risk Analyzers and Astro Trains are active at maximum intensity. The map type makes it so getting anywhere takes a very long time, so these'll be hard to deal with.

This isn't quite a normal or default scenario, nor is it difficulty 10, but this combination of AI types and map type is nasty, with Turtle fortress worlds constantly blocking your way, and the Vicious Raider sending very powerful waves.
